  "contentHtml": "<div class=\"figure-video\" data-ke-type=\"video\" data-video-url=\"https://kakaotv.daum.net/embed/player/cliplink/ve470O42TrrAa4ahkOq2XJk@my?service=daum_cafe\" data-video-host=\"kakaotv\" data-video-play-service=\"daum_cafe\" data-video-width=\"712\" data-video-height=\"400\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-video-thumbnail=\"http://i1.daumcdn.net/svc/image/U03/tvpot_thumb/ve470O42TrrAa4ahkOq2XJk/thumb.png\" data-ke-mobile-mobilestyle=\"widthContent\" data-video-origin-width=\"712\" data-video-origin-height=\"400\"><iframe src=\"https://kakaotv.daum.net/embed/player/cliplink/ve470O42TrrAa4ahkOq2XJk?service=daum_cafe&amp;f=p&amp;ptoken=eyJhbGciOiJIUzUxMiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6InZlNDcwTzQyVHJyQWE0YWhrT3EyWEprIiwidGlkIjoiNmRjY2U2YWYtYjg5Ny00N2IzLWFiYmYtMDI1NDU1ZjkwODZiIiwiYXBwX2lkIjoiZGF1bV9jYWZlIiwiZXhwIjoxNzg2MTg5ODU3fQ.NuqNoCTcWePgCpbw_-latFcKlMeluRpDhiWMfCTv4E3yxzdmZ1zEV4cF7ichq-wYSl70DmPaLzlZOo0w3P3Thg&amp;autoplay=0\" width=\"712\" height=\"400\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen=\"\" allow=\"encrypted-media\"></iframe><div class=\"figcaption\"></div></div><p>아이가 재미있는 장난감을 가져왔어요. <br><br>납작하게 비닐이 접혀있어서 젤리인줄 알았는데 광선검이라 하네요.</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/9986414C5B7D5A640E\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/9986414C5B7D5A640E\" data-origin-width=\"720\" data-origin-height=\"307\"></div><p>비닐 안에 볼록한 부분을 누르면 <br>비닐이 터지면서 속에 액체와 가루가 반응해서 기체가 발생해 검이 되네요. 하하 (분해 사진은 bj 영상 캡쳐입니다)</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/99A4424D5B7D5A651F\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/99A4424D5B7D5A651F\" data-origin-width=\"720\" data-origin-height=\"428\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/9928BC435B7D5A660E\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/9928BC435B7D5A660E\" data-origin-width=\"720\" data-origin-height=\"468\"></div><p>장난감 아이디어 좋네요 ㅎㅎ<br><br>흡열반응인지 검이 차갑고. 검색해보니 개당 300원 미만으로 실험하기도 좋고 탐구하기도 만만하네요. <br><br>애가 가지고 논다고 분해를 못하게 해서 ㅎㅎ<br><br>흰가루와 투명 액체...흡열반응. 저렴. 기체발생. <br><br>무엇일까요? <br><br>구연산+탄산수소나트륨 혼합가루에 물? 일까요...? ^-^</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/9934F64A5B7D5A6710\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/9934F64A5B7D5A6710\" data-origin-width=\"720\" data-origin-height=\"998\"></div>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
